---
title: "debt::accrue_interest (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_index: borrow_index <= new_borrow_index?
    q_check_index --> q_error_backwards: borrow_index > new_borrow_index
    q_check_index --> q_check_equal: borrow_index <= new_borrow_index
    q_error_backwards --> [*]: abort invariant_borrow_index_incremental
    q_check_equal --> q_skip: borrow_index == new_borrow_index
    q_check_equal --> q_calc: borrow_index < new_borrow_index
    q_skip --> [*]: return (no change)
    q_calc --> q_update: new_amount = amount * new_borrow_index / old_borrow_index
    q_update --> [*]: self.amount = new_amount, self.borrow_index = new_borrow_index

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: borrow_index is monotonically non-decreasing
        INV-002: debt amount monotonically non-decreasing from interest alone
        INV-003: debt = principal * current_index / original_index
    end note
